<title>USA: Leap Group says CEO buys 1 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Leap Group says CEO buys 1 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leap Group Inc said on Wednesday that chairman and chief executive officer R. Steven Lutterbach bought one million shares of the company's common stock from executive vice president and co-founder Joseph Sciarrotta.</p>
<p>Lutterbach's holdings now total 3.4 million shares or 25 percent of the company, Leap said.</p>
<p>Sciarrotta continues to hold 1.34 million shares of Leap Group and will continue as executive vice president and chief creative officer, Leap said.</p>
</text>
